WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.943
Lab 2 uses your own exports, from a test
tenant with an inbound provisioning

2
00:00:04.943 --> 00:00:09.600
job and a SailPoint sandbox, never
production; the authors haven't run it.

3
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.162
Both reads are GET only.

4
00:00:11.162 --> 00:00:15.449
Export the job's schema and note
the directory name it actually uses.

5
00:00:15.449 --> 00:00:21.338
Export the SailPoint source's policies
with an API client holding one read scope.

6
00:00:21.338 --> 00:00:23.966
Build the alias list from
the source's account

7
00:00:23.966 --> 00:00:26.525
schema and have the data
architect review it.

8
00:00:26.525 --> 00:00:30.188
Run the check, and hand each
Finding to the data architect.

9
00:00:30.188 --> 00:00:31.220
Then clean up.
